41. A bank shall draw up their standard operating procedure (SOP) for System based NPA classification for usage by the operating staff. C. Classification as non-performing asset

42. A bank shall classify a loan or an advance as NPA if any of the following conditions is satisfied:

(1) interest and / or instalment of principal remains overdue for a period of more than 90 days in respect of a term loan;

