7. An illustrative list of reviews to be carried out by the Board or a Committee(s) to which powers have been delegated is provided below. The specific aspects to be covered in these reviews are detailed in the relevant paragraphs of these Directions.

(1) Review of customer service / customer care aspects once in six months.

