information and documents. D. Issue of Pre-paid Payment Instruments 32. A licensed RCB desirous of issuing Prepaid Payment Instruments (PPIs) shall have its own ATM network and there should be no restrictions on acceptance or repayment of deposits. Further, issuance of Prepaid Payment Instruments, shall be subject to compliance with eligibility criteria and other guidelines as prescribed by Department of Payment and Settlement Systems (DPSS), RBI from time to time.

